{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o118a","title":"乌丸单于至易水来贺","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o118a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操到易水，普富卢、那楼率名王来贺。","evidence":["wudi-e-o118a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受贺","evidence":["wudi-e-o118a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0248","role":"来贺","evidence":["wudi-e-o118a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0249","role":"来贺","evidence":["wudi-e-o118a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"易水","evidence":["wudi-e-o118a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十二年十一月","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o118a-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"建安十二年十一月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,638,"O118a"],"order":261},{"id":"wudi-e-o182b","title":"普富卢率侯王来朝","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o182b-account","label":"正文","text":"代郡乌丸行单于普富卢与侯王来朝。","evidence":["wudi-e-o182b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0248","role":"来朝","evidence":["wudi-e-o182b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受朝","evidence":["wudi-e-o182b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安二十一年","year":216,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o182b-q","wudi-q-o181","wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681"],"chronology":"wudi-y216","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o181","basis":"建安二十一年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1035,"O182b"],"order":389}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0248","name":"普富卢","evidence":["wudi-q-o118"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o118-wudi-p0248","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o118"]},{"id":"wudi-m-o182-wudi-p0248","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o182"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o118a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-da8446766804b1735902","layer":"original","quote":"十一月，至易水〖19〗，代郡乌丸行单于普富卢、上郡乌丸行单于那楼〖20〗，将其名王来贺。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":637,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"wudi-e-o182b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1ba26cc63c829846d4a9","layer":"original","quote":"代郡乌丸行单于普富卢，与其侯王来朝。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":34},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十一年：建安二十一年（公元 216）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6fbf1801762e86de3cad","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151},{"id":"wudi-q-o118","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-da8446766804b1735902","layer":"original","quote":"十一月，至易水〖19〗，代郡乌丸行单于普富卢、上郡乌丸行单于那楼〖20〗，将其名王来贺。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":637,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"wudi-q-o181","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-13ff126a9ae1c811de3d","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年春二月〖1〗，公还邺。﹝一﹞三月壬寅〖2〗，公亲耕籍田。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35},{"id":"wudi-q-o182","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1ba26cc63c829846d4a9","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，天子进公爵为魏王。﹝三﹞代郡乌丸行单于普富卢，与其侯王来朝。天子命王女为公主〖3〗，食汤沐邑〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
